# A conversation's image opens in the app's viewer beside the conversation's
# generated images, each of which it shows when pressed. The viewer magnifies
# by steps and by ⌘ + wheel and resets, saves the image where the user
# chooses, and closes.
# iOS: testSimulatorOpensOnlyTheTappedImageAndSavesIt (Quick Look there)
expect "検証プロジェクト" 30000
press このプロジェクトで新しいチャット
type "AI に依頼する" "[generated-images] [immediate] 生成画像を表示します"
press 送信
expect "生成画像を表示しました。" 30000
expect_absent "画像を読み込み中…" 20000
press 画像を拡大
expect 倍率をリセット 20000
# Which of the two generated images is first in the tree varies.
expect " / 2" 20000
press "生成画像 1"
expect "1 / 2"
press 拡大
expect 125%
press 拡大
expect 150%
press 倍率をリセット
expect 100%
# ⌘ + wheel over the image zooms it a notch at a time, the label following;
# the buttons go on from there to the quarter on either side.
scroll プレビュー -1 held cmd
expect 125%
scroll プレビュー -1 held cmd
expect 156%
press 拡大
expect 175%
scroll プレビュー 1 held cmd
expect 140%
press 倍率をリセット
expect 100%
press 縮小
expect 75%
screenshot viewer
press "生成画像 2"
expect "2 / 2"
expect 100%
press 保存
choose "$AGENT_STATE_DIR/saved image.png"
expect_file "$AGENT_STATE_DIR/saved image.png"
expect 保存済み
press 閉じる after 保存済み
expect_absent 倍率をリセット
expect "生成画像を表示しました。"
